+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
+// NX_OVERLAY=1: a small metrics panel copied into the top-left corner of each displayed frame (nvn_overlay.cpp).
+// FPS: frames the game submitted per second; VPS: frames shown per second (equal unless a frame is dropped or
+// repeated); frame time average and worst over the last half second; frames over 20 ms; render size; FG: frame
+// generation (none exists here, always OFF). Text is drawn on the CPU and copied, so no shader or pipeline is added.
