+// ---- input: wired Switch-layout USB pads (HID) ---------------------------------------------------------------------
+// PowerA (VID 20D6) and HORI (VID 0F0D) wired pads are HID gamepads, not XInput devices. Their input report (after
+// the report ID) is: u16 buttons (Y B A X L R ZL ZR - + LS RS Home Capture), a hat (0 up .. 7 up-left, 8+ none), then
+// LX LY RX RY as bytes centred on 0x80 (Y down). hid.dll and setupapi.dll are loaded at run time; a reader thread
